<title>UK: CRICKET-ENGLAND 172 AND 102-4, AUSTRALIA 501-9 DEC - TEA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND 172 AND 102-4, AUSTRALIA 501-9 DEC - TEA.</headline>
<dateline>LEEDS, England 1997-07-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>England, 329 behind Australia on first innings, were 102-4 in their second innings at tea on the fourth day of the fourth test at Headingley on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: England 172 and 102-4, Australia 501-9 declared.</p>
